  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Page render with Figure 2, 'Prevalence (%) of different HPV types among women with cancer, by region': a stacked bar chart for Central/South America, North America/Europe, Northern Africa and South Asia, with segments for HPV types 16, 18, 45, 31, 33, 52, 58 and others. HPV 16 is the largest share in every region (57, 70, 68 and 53%), followed by HPV 18 (13, 15, 17 and 26%). The page also has text on HPV vaccines.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
